# Not a container: the `aihub` runner framework (aihub/) and the app skeleton (app/) shared
# by aihub-litert-models-runner and aihub-onnx-models-runner, which read them from the
# "framework" bake context (see docker-bake.hcl). Their Python dependencies are declared in
# each runner base's pyproject.toml.

# Development-only material that must not end up in the images.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
